flowchart TD
    S1["Authorized target + per-endpoint business context + budget<br/>asset_registry.json &middot; localhost only"]:::ext --> PROF
    CAT[("Approved catalog<br/>templates &middot; kind &middot; cost")]:::code --> PROF
    PROF["Profiler &mdash; CODE<br/>run cheap INDICATOR checks (toy) / fingerprint version (Grafana)"]:::code --> CAND["Candidate validations per endpoint<br/>+ business importance"]:::code
    NUC[("Nuclei CLI")]:::code -. "indicator scan" .-> PROF
    CAND --> PLAN

    subgraph LOOP["Decision loop &mdash; repeat up to the budget, ONE validation per round"]
    direction TB
        PLAN["Planner PROPOSES one template id + reason<br/>A / B1 / B2 / C &middot; only C is the LLM &middot; sees evidence so far"]:::model --> GATE{"Policy gate &mdash; CODE<br/>in scope? in catalog? in budget?"}:::code
        GATE -->|blocked| BLK["Block + log"]:::code
        GATE -->|approved| RUN["Nuclei runs exactly ONE template"]:::code
        RUN --> VER["Verifier &mdash; CODE assigns verdict<br/>CONFIRMED / NOT_CONFIRMED / UNVERIFIED / ..."]:::code
        VER --> EV["Append verdict to evidence + trace"]:::code
        EV -->|"budget left &amp; planner did not stop"| PLAN
    end

    EV ==>|"budget spent or planner stops"| REP["Report &mdash; CODE<br/>findings + business priority + full trace"]:::code
    NUC -. "one template at a time" .-> RUN
    ENF["Enforced in CODE: allowlist &middot; one-at-a-time &middot; rate limit &middot; no OAST &middot; stop switch &middot; JSONL trace"]:::code -.-> GATE

